\f0\fs26 \cf0 Phoenix Interceptor\
by JoshTigerheart and Renesis\
v1.0 (4-10-07)\
\
Want a competitive car that isn't based on real life for once?  Tired of all the original vehicles being either jokes or novelties, only used by players who are bored?  Presenting the Nibos Class Phoenix Racer: Phoenix Interceptor Variant!  Blasting in from the future at several hundred miles per hour, the Phoenix Interceptor is an original car designed with competitive racing in mind.  \
\
This vehicle's XG4 Dralon Plasma Turbo engine makes it blindingly fast with acceleration that'll shame anything else, shooting this car's light frame ahead of the pack in no time.  However, such speed does come with a cost.  Handling is a bit more challenging than it is with other cars, especially other 4WDs, and brakes are a bit lacking, preventing you (and your opponents) from just careening through the course at high speeds without a single worry.  Also, keep in mind this car is pretty light, so it isn't the best dirty racer.\
\
This car is most effective in simulation, strict, and arcade modes where its power and speed are easily distinguished.  In turbo arcade, it does not benefit as much as other cars from the speed boosts, but it is still quicker than almost everything else out there.\
\
Questions?  Comments?  Bug reports?  Send them to TwilightPhoenix@gmail.com.\
